{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10101","headline":"元日观百僚朝会 · 包佶","name":"元日观百僚朝会","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万国贺唐尧，清晨会百僚。\n花冠萧相府，绣服霍嫖姚。\n寿色凝丹槛，欢声彻九霄。\n御鑪分兽炭，仙管弄云韶。\n日照金觞动，风吹玉佩摇。\n都城献赋者，不得共趋朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}